# Where the API will live once #126's migration off Railway actually cuts
# over -- not yet: production traffic is still Railway (see main.py's
# DEPLOYED_COMMIT and smoke.yml), and this value is inert until a human
# either disconnects Railway's Vercel integration or sets VITE_API_URL
# explicitly on the family-tree-web project, both dashboard actions.
# Public, not a secret, so it lives in the repo rather than in Vercel's
# dashboard. A separate Vercel project from this one on purpose: #126 kept
# the API and web app on two origins rather than folding them into one
# same-origin Service, which is its own decision with its own PR, not
# something to fold into a platform migration.
VITE_API_URL=https://family-tree-api-stevemarvell-team.vercel.app
